<title>USA: Roper Industries sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Roper Industries sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>BOGART, Ga. 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roper Industries Inc said Monday it has declared a two-for-one stock split in the form of a 100 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The company said the stock dividend will be distributed on Aug. 1 to shareholders of record at the end of business on July 25.</p>
</text>
